<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Contact — J. Angel Sosa</title>
<meta name="description" content="Get in touch with José Ángel Sosa López by email or WhatsApp.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wdth,wght@62..125,400..900&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,500;1,8..60,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --cobalt:#0057D9; --cobalt-deep:#003F9E; --cobalt-light:#2E7CFF;
  --paper:#F7F8FA; --white:#FFFFFF; --graphite:#111418; --ink2:#5C6673; --line:#C9D0D8;
  --grot:"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif; --serif:"Source Serif 4",Georgia,serif;
  --margin:clamp(24px,4vw,72px); --max:1600px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--white);color:var(--graphite);font-family:var(--grot);font-size:clamp(16px,.35vw + 14px,20px);line-height:1.55;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
h1,h2,p{margin:0} a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cobalt);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:var(--margin)}

.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:var(--white);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.topbar .row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-block:16px;gap:16px}
.topbar a.home{font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
.topbar nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;font-size:14px}
.topbar nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink2)}
.topbar .lang{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}
.topbar .lang a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink2)}
.topbar .lang a[aria-current]{color:var(--graphite);font-weight:700}

.banner{width:100%;aspect-ratio:21/8;overflow:hidden;background:var(--paper)}
.banner img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 30%;display:block}
@media (max-width:700px){.banner{aspect-ratio:4/3}}

.intro{background:var(--white)}
.intro .wrap{padding-block:clamp(40px,7vh,72px);max-width:900px}
.intro h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,52px);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:16px}
.intro p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:clamp(16px,1.3vw,19px);max-width:56ch}

.channels{background:var(--paper);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.channels .wrap{padding-block:clamp(40px,7vh,72px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}
.channel{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.channel b{font-size:19px}
.channel span{color:var(--ink2);font-size:14px}
.channel a.action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;background:var(--cobalt);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-size:15px;width:fit-content}
.channel.whatsapp a.action{background:#25D366;color:#06340f}
.channel .copy-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2)}
.channel button.copy{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--graphite);font-size:12px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--grot)}
.channel button.copy[data-copied="true"]{border-color:var(--cobalt);color:var(--cobalt)}
@media (max-width:700px){.channels .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

footer{background:var(--white);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
footer .wrap{padding-block:24px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}
footer a{text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap row">
    <a class="home" href="/">JAS</a>
    <nav aria-label="Site">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/ebook/">Book</a>
      <a href="/author/">Author</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Language">
      <a href="/contact/" aria-current="page">EN</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/es/contacto/">ES</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<figure class="banner"><img src="/assets/jas-warm.jpg" alt="José Ángel Sosa López at home" loading="eager"></figure>

<section class="intro">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Let's talk.</h1>
    <p>Whether it's about the book, a portfolio leadership role, or just a good conversation about products and systems — pick whichever channel is easiest for you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="channels">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="channel">
      <b>Email</b>
      <span>Usually the fastest way to reach me for anything formal — recruiting, speaking, collaboration.</span>
      <a class="action" href="mailto:jasosalopez@outlook.com">Write an email ↗</a>
      <div class="copy-row">
        <span id="emailText">jasosalopez@outlook.com</span>
        <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="jasosalopez@outlook.com" data-target="emailCopyBtn" id="emailCopyBtn">Copy</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="channel whatsapp">
      <b>WhatsApp</b>
      <span>For a quicker, more direct conversation.</span>
      <a class="action" href="https://wa.me/525527733205" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open WhatsApp ↗</a>
      <div class="copy-row">
        <span id="phoneText">+52 55 2773 3205</span>
        <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="+525527733205" data-target="phoneCopyBtn" id="phoneCopyBtn">Copy</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>José Ángel Sosa López — Contact · <span style="opacity:.7">Design by Tecronomic, SAPI de CV</span></span>
    <span><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/ebook/">The living book</a> · <a href="/author/">Author</a></span>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('button.copy').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const value = btn.getAttribute('data-copy') || '';
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
        const original = btn.textContent;
        btn.textContent = 'Copied';
        btn.setAttribute('data-copied', 'true');
        setTimeout(() => {
          btn.textContent = original;
          btn.removeAttribute('data-copied');
        }, 1800);
      } catch (err) {
        btn.textContent = 'Select & copy manually';
      }
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
